# phase2_demo.re - Phase 2 competitive gate demo (CLI command script).
# Module: demo (antinomia script).
# Owns: dual-OS documented RE workflow: attach/self-debuggee through DB export.
# Depends: antinomia CLI. Linux ELF fixture substituted at configure time.
#
# Linux (headless CTest): configured copy with @INFERIOR@ -> loop_inferior.
# Windows PE fixture path (run manually / CI when Win backend is live):
#   init tests/fixtures/breakpoint_me.exe
#   # or: init <build>/bin/loop.exe
# Symbol names below match loop_inferior exports; on Windows use the PE exports
# of breakpoint_me / loop (adjust module:symbol accordingly).
#
# wait_event takes an optional timeout_ms so headless CI cannot hang forever.

init @INFERIOR@
wait_event 5000
wait_event 5000
modules
signals
maps
bp loop_inferior:antinomia_touch
bpc loop_inferior:antinomia_touch 1
bplog loop_inferior:antinomia_touch touch_hit
bph loop_inferior:antinomia_watch 4 w
run
wait_event 5000
bpdll libm
bt
tracestart
tracestep 4
tracesave @TRACE_OUT@
bm 0x0 phase2_demo
dbsave
kill
